hts.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\u202fHow severely C\u2019s communication challenges and egocentric style will affect real\u2011time coordination and crew feedback during extended operations.\n**What would change my vote:**\u202fIf evidence emerged that C\u2019s communication deficits lead to critical misunderstandings or that his egocentric behavior significantly degrades crew performance, I would reconsider A (if his organizational issues proved manageable) or B (if his uncooperativeness were less impactful than anticipated).\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
