f:** B\u2019s interpersonal negatives (making nasty remarks, occasional pretentiousness) versus the more operationally critical gaps in the other candidates (unknown stress handling for A and D, severe communication deficits for C). The explicit evidence that B remains calm under pressure and is highly conscientious outweighs his moderate teamwork concerns.\n**Remaining uncertainty:** How severely B\u2019s \u201cnasty remarks\u201d and pretentious tone would affect real\u2011time crew coordination and safety\u2011critical communication on long flights.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that B\u2019s interpersonal behavior leads to crew conflict or safety\u2011critical miscommunication, or credible information showing that A (or D) possesses strong stress\u2011management and that their technical/leadership strengths can mitigate their interpersonal flaws, or that C\u2019s communication issues are minor in practice.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
