n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that B\u2019s interpersonal behavior leads to crew conflict or safety\u2011critical miscommunication; or credible information showing that A or D possess strong stress\u2011management abilities that offset their interpersonal flaws, or that C\u2019s communication issues are minor in practice.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
